      "diagnosis": "The task relies on correctly parsing MATPOWER bus/gen/branch fields (Pd, RATE_A, X, TAP, SHIFT, etc.). Mis-indexing or misinterpreting units (MW vs pu, RATE_A usage) can yield wrong constraints and a dispatch that is not comparable to the verifier’s optimal model.",
      "repair_instruction": "Add a concise MATPOWER column index reference for bus/gen/branch fields needed in this task (Pd, baseKV optional, GEN_BUS, PMIN/PMAX, branch F_BUS/T_BUS, BR_X, RATE_A, TAP, SHIFT) and explicitly state units (MW, degrees) and required conversions to pu. Include a warning to always use RATE_A as the thermal limit for DC-OPF unless specified otherwise, and to treat TAP=0 as 1.0."
